message: "Please cite the exact source commit or archived version of this verification packet."
title: "Exact cocycle and twisted-boundary verification for Family 199"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-23
authors:
  - family-names: Towell
    given-names: Alexander Richard
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6443-9897"
